Mantella NPCs who know where they stand with you.

[center][size=5][font=Trebuchet MS][b][color=#93c47d]WHAT MANTELLA LEARNS[/color][/b][/font][/size][/center][table][tr][th]Mod[/th][th]Mantella learns[/th][/tr][tr][td]MARAS[/td][td]Married, engaged, candidate or divorced; your spouses when asked[/td][/tr][tr][td]Romantasy[/td][td]Bond tier and points; talking earns points[/td][/tr][tr][td]Lover's Ledger[/td][td]Your history together, her favourite acts, her other lovers[/td][/tr][tr][td]After a scene[/td][td]She opens a conversation and speaks first[/td][/tr][/table][center][size=5][font=Trebuchet MS][b][color=#93c47d]REQUIREMENTS[/color][/b][/font][/size][/center][list]
